# RESTORE-FAIL: the map restore rename itself fails -> rc 1, the unrestored
# target and the retained backup are named, and the new map stays.
# RUN: mkdir -p e1 && cd e1 && printf 'OLD-MAP-MMMM' > out.map && printf 'OLD-REP-RRRR' > out.report
